{"title":"2021 Fall AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">2021 Fall AMC 10A #7</a> and <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2021 Fall AMC 12A #6</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Extension)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Extension)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Simple_and_Quick)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Simple and Quick)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_HS_Competition_Academy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by HS Competition Academy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As shown in the figure below, point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lies on the opposite half-plane determined by line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> from point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/4/914f9e937f664b4c894be7882924cd5a11b13c5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CDE = 110^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"118\" height=\"15\" />. Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lies on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/b/cfbb4c52e011ceed6e813118a7d59e931af444a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AD}$\" width=\"29\" height=\"15\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/e/bbeb5f246af1d97f9d24890824cbc4a41c71bf58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE=DF$\" width=\"84\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is a square. What is the degree measure of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a053a2fd6ac8ef0ab8f8530fc73eb38e6ff59de9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AFE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/9/8d9ddc29373bd395df63dedaac4b8f1eb11201cd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(6cm); pair A = (0,10); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, N); pair B = (0,0); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, S); pair C = (10,0); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, S); pair D = (10,10); label(&quot;$D$&quot;, D, SW); pair EE = (15,11.8); label(&quot;$E$&quot;, EE, N); pair F = (3,10); label(&quot;$F$&quot;, F, N); filldraw(D--arc(D,2.5,270,380)--cycle,lightgray); dot(A^^B^^C^^D^^EE^^F); draw(A--B--C--D--cycle); draw(D--EE--F--cycle); label(&quot;$110^\\circ$&quot;, (15,9), SW); [/asy]\" width=\"285\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/d/a0d54d7750ec3c532c120694f324bcfe35ea2697.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }160\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }164\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }166\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }170\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }174$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"446\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By angle subtraction, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/2/332b6279b643443ba6796987d5233c221066755c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ADE = 360^\\circ - \\angle ADC - \\angle CDE = 160^\\circ.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"340\" height=\"16\" /> Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/2/872e3b09425c9659d782119a543dc858aa520a40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle DEF$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> is isosceles, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/2/922e760a64aa407de5179e8b8ffcaa65e7e9ab5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DFE = \\frac{180^\\circ - \\angle ADE}{2}=10^\\circ.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"256\" height=\"39\" /> Finally, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/5/7e58dc969977fd9539d200c54fb377fd5ae43f77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AFE = 180^\\circ - \\angle DFE = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }170}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"294\" height=\"30\" /> degrees.\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM ~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Aops-g5-gethsemanea2\" title=\"User:Aops-g5-gethsemanea2\">Aops-g5-gethsemanea2</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Extension.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Extension)\">Solution 2 (Extension)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Extension)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can extend <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/b/cfbb4c52e011ceed6e813118a7d59e931af444a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AD}$\" width=\"29\" height=\"15\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, making <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/0/f40f5a436a8645e0eb6ec0e7ccc7135a54b47cc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CDG$\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> a right angle. It follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/d/e6d5cb237a316428e3b3754f51b3b853449753f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle GDE$\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/5/af559725659522ec17dbe9fb3d5b64538c088206.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$110^\\circ - 90^\\circ = 20^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"135\" height=\"16\" />, as shown below.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/a/91ab5d77b49f589e0ebd38313d10ed34ae5489a0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(6cm); pair A = (0,10); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, N); pair B = (0,0); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, S); pair C = (10,0); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, S); pair D = (10,10); label(&quot;$D$&quot;, D, SW); pair EE = (15,11.8); label(&quot;$E$&quot;, EE, N); pair F = (3,10); label(&quot;$F$&quot;, F, N); pair G = (15,10); label(&quot;$G$&quot;, G, E); filldraw(D--arc(D,2.5,270,380)--cycle,lightgray); dot(A^^B^^C^^D^^EE^^F^^G); draw(A--B--C--D--G--cycle); draw(D--EE--F--cycle); [/asy]\" width=\"285\" height=\"242\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/5/c25fb99a28dc9316fecd99612c19f6fdef5ffc97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DFE = \\angle DEF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"140\" height=\"14\" />, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a6e5fe739cae6bab35c767bbc988205727effca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DFE = \\angle DEF = \\frac{20}{2} = 10^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"237\" height=\"38\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/2/aa29f71e32ab01d881adb39c970fce9a408bb5e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AFE = 180^\\circ - 10^\\circ = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)} ~170}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"262\" height=\"30\" /> degrees.\n</p><p>~MrThinker\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Simple_and_Quick.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Simple_and_Quick)\">Video Solution (Simple and Quick)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Simple and Quick)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/cBLyn2HZ5YY\">https://youtu.be/cBLyn2HZ5YY</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>for AMC 10: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ycRZHCOKTVk?t=232\">https://youtu.be/ycRZHCOKTVk?t=232</a>\n</p><p>for AMC 12: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/wlDlByKI7A8\">https://youtu.be/wlDlByKI7A8</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/9nUZhyhi9_o\">https://youtu.be/9nUZhyhi9_o</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_HS_Competition_Academy\">Video Solution by HS Competition Academy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by HS Competition Academy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/l3nnd-eWOI0\">https://youtu.be/l3nnd-eWOI0</a>\n</p><p>~Charles3829\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/T4NhPER6SrM\">https://youtu.be/T4NhPER6SrM</a>\n</p><p>~Lucas\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 12A\">2021 Fall AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a